 "text": "Hello there, how are you holding up? In general, yes. A good webcam gives much more natural looking videos than those cropped from cameras, especially for something like video calls. Then the difference matters. Spend bit more and buy a laptop with a good webcam, you'll be glad of it. That works but then you lose the nice feature of the webcam being automatically ready. A simple USB adapter is really simple. Then an external webcam should work fine, Mount it near the window and you' good to go.",
